TITLE Mixing DIC and Ca solutions with calcite, heating 20 to 200C

SOLUTION 1
    temp 20
    pH 7 charge
    units mmol/kgw
    C(4) 50
    Ca 0

SOLUTION 2
    temp 20
    pH 7 charge
    units mmol/kgw
    C(4) 0
    Ca 50

EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    Calcite 0 0

MIX 1
    1 0.5
    2 0.5

REACTION_TEMPERATURE 1
    20 200 in 10 steps

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -reset false
    -temperature true
    -si Aragonite

END
